# PROVISION PLUGIN
#
#        two defined methods are mandatory:
#        - create    responsible for creation of what is needed to use this provision method. returns <True|False>,"message"
#        - cleanup   responsible for deletion of no longer needed files. returns <True|False>,"message"
#
#        one defined variable is mandatory which will be used during node installation time
#        - fetch     contains the actual bash snippet to fetch the image

# Plugin selection based on the following search path and priority:
#
# 1 primary provisioning method  e.g. plugins/boot/provision/http.py
# 2 backup provisioning method   e.g. plugins/boot/provision/torrent.py
#
# Both are loaded, by name, from the node's provision_method and provision_fallback.
